# Build context for the php-sapi image: the workspace manifests, the crate and
# the fixtures. Everything heavy or unrelated (the host's target/, the built
# site, the plan tree, the published package) stays out, so a rebuild after a
# fixture tweak is seconds instead of a copy of a 48 GiB target directory.
.git
target
target-mut
mutants.out
dist
site
tmp
plan
docs
python
**/__pycache__
